  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.31 Tax year",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.31 “Tax year” means the time period beginning April 1 of any year and ending March 31 of the next year, inclusive.\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 401.30)",
